[151.046166, "o", "    print(r[\"predicted_class_id\"], round(r[\"confidence\"],4), r[\"text\"])\r\nEOF — approved\r\n  ⚙ bash cd /app && python3 - <<'EOF' import json, torch from transformers impo…\r\n    ✓ bash — exit 0\r\n  qwen3.8-27b — 12 tool call(s) so far\r\n[approval] bash: ls /app/model_cache/xlm-roberta-base /app/merged_model; python3 -c \"import json; d=json.load(open('/app/detection_results.json')); print(len(d), 'entries'); print(json.dumps(d[0], ensure_ascii=False))\" — approved\r\n  ⚙ bash ls /app/model_cache/xlm-roberta-base /app/merged_model; python3 -c \"im…\r\n    ✓ bash — exit 0\r\n  qwen3.8-27b — 13 tool call(s) so far\r\n  qwen3.8-27b — 14 tool call(s) so far\r\n  ⚙ todo \r\n    ✓ todo — 5/5 done\r\nAll done. Summary:\r\n\r\n**Setup**\r\n- Installed `torch` (CPU), `transformers` 5.22.1, `peft` 0.21.2\r\n- Downloaded `FacebookAI/xlm-roberta-base` and `dominguesm/xlm-roberta-base-lora-language-detection` via HF Hub\r\n\r\n**Model configuration**\r\n- Base model reconfigured with `num_labels=20` and the 20-language `id2lab"]
[151.046236, "o", "el`/`label2id` (ar, bg, de, el, en, es, fr, hi, it, ja, nl, pl, pt, ru, sw, th, tr, ur, vi, zh — matching the adapter's config), saved with tokenizer to `/app/model_cache/xlm-roberta-base`\r\n- LoRA adapter (r=8, alpha=16, target: query/value, `modules_to_save: classifier`) applied via `PeftModel`, then `merge_and_unload()` and saved to `/app/merged_model/` (20-class classifier confirmed in the merged weights)\r\n\r\n**Detection results** (`/app/detection_results.json`, 10 entries, argmax of logits as `predicted_class_id`):\r\n\r\n| Sample | Class ID | Confidence |\r\n|---|---|---|\r\n| Bonjour… (fr) | 6 | 0.975 |\r\n| Hola… (es) | 5 | 0.989 |\r\n| Guten Tag… (de) | 2 | 0.997 |\r\n| Ciao… (it) | 8 | 0.989 |\r\n| Olá… (pt) | 12 | 0.990 |\r\n| Привет… (ru) | 13 | 0.986 |\r\n| こんにちは… (ja) | 9 | 0.965 |\r\n| 你好… (zh) | 19 | 0.936 |\r\n| مرحبا… (ar) | 0 | 0.988 |\r\n| Hello… (en) | 4 | 0.974 |\r\n\r\nAll 10 predictions match the expected languages with high confidence, consistent with the adapter's rep"]
[151.046242, "o", "orted 99.43% accuracy on the training dataset.\r\n\r\n[result] role=implementor model=qwen3.8-27b tools=14 surface=9a6bfc32cece\r\n"]
